2026-11-06T03:19:03.5771173Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5771412Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5771632Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5771949Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5772243Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5789524Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5790121Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5793197Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5793718Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:19:03.5794099Z 
